The files in this directory are the terminal-emulator library from
termux-app v0.118.1 (https://github.com/termux/termux-app/tree/v0.118.1/terminal-emulator),
derived from Android-Terminal-Emulator by Jack Palevich, and are licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
They are vendored unmodified. Tether does not use TerminalSession/JNI (local
process spawning); the native library is never loaded.
